 {r}←Register;plugin;folder
⍝ Register this plugin with EWC. Safe before or after EWC.Init.
⍝     ]link.create ~/dev/ewc/EWC
⍝     ]link.create ApexChartsPlugin ~/dev/ewc-plugins/apexcharts/APLSource
⍝     ApexChartsPlugin.Register
⍝     EWC.Init 'Browser'
 folder←Folder

⍝ Name, Folder (location on disk), Classes for EWC, Resources/static assets, Inject this JS
 plugin←⎕NS''
 plugin.Name←'ApexCharts'
 plugin.Folder←folder
 plugin.Classes←classes
 plugin.Resources←'apexcharts'(folder,'/assets')
 plugin.Inject←Inject

 r←#.EWC.RegisterPlugin plugin
